description:
List the SEO Reporting reports built for a property. Each item carries id, name, is_template, is_automate, created_at and owner. By default returns plain reports; pass templates=true to list report templates instead. Recurring/scheduled reports are excluded here — use list_report_schedules for those. Cursor-paginated: pass the returned next_cursor back as cursor to page. Use a report id with get_report or generate_report. Pass the property ID (UUID) or URL (sc-domain:...) from list_properties.

Cost: 2 credits per call.

Examples:
```json
// list the property's reports.
{"property":"sc-domain:example.com"}

// list report templates instead of plain reports.
{"property":"sc-domain:example.com","templates":true}
```
